      "role": "user",
      "content": "the \"different path\" thing sounds nice in theory but it doesn't change the reality. i wake up every day and the weight of just... being here... is just too much. it feels like there's no point to the effort if the end result is always just feeling this hollow. like i'm just dragging this heavy version of myself through a world that wasn't made for me.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
