      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "You're right—there's no easy fix for that weight, and I won't pretend there is. But the fact that you can name that hollowness so clearly means you're not numb to it; you're still feeling, still searching. That's not nothing. Maybe the goal isn't to fit the world's shape, but to find one small moment today that feels less heavy—even if it's just a breath, a song, or a quiet corner. You don't have to carry the whole weight at once.",
