      "content": "but what if i don't want to find a small moment? what if i'm just tired of the whole cycle? it feels like people always tell you to just \"cope\" or \"find a way through,\" but sometimes the struggle itself is just... constant. it feels like it would be so much easier to just not have to deal with the exhaustion anymore. to just stop the noise.",
